exports[`pedagogical-integration demo cases > category: definie > renders (int_1^e 1/x dx) 1`] = `
"
###### (int_1^e 1/x dx) ######

Expression: \\dfrac{1}{x} from 1 to e

========== LYCEE (summarized) ==========
- [identify-definite-integral] Identification de l'intégrale définie
  \\textcolor{blue}{\\int_{1}^{e} \\dfrac{1}{x}\\,dx}
- [apply-known-primitive] Primitive usuelle
  \\begin{aligned} & \\textcolor{blue}{\\int \\dfrac{1}{x}\\,dx} \\\\ & = \\ln\\left( \\left| x \\right| \\right) \\end{aligned}
- [apply-fundamental-theorem] Théorème fondamental du calcul intégral
  \\begin{aligned} & \\textcolor{blue}{\\int_{1}^{e} \\dfrac{1}{x}\\,dx} \\\\ & = \\left[\\ln\\left( \\left| x \\right| \\right)\\right]_{1}^{e} \\end{aligned}
- [substitute-bounds] Évaluation aux bornes
  \\begin{aligned} & \\textcolor{blue}{\\left[\\ln\\left( \\left| x \\right| \\right)\\right]_{1}^{e}} \\\\ & = \\ln\\left( \\left| e \\right| \\right) - \\ln\\left( \\left| 1 \\right| \\right) \\end{aligned}
- [simplify-bounds-result] Calcul de la valeur
  \\begin{aligned} & \\textcolor{blue}{\\ln\\left( \\left| e \\right| \\right) - \\ln\\left( \\left| 1 \\right| \\right)} \\\\ & = \\ln\\left( e \\right) \\end{aligned}
Antiderivative: \\ln\\left( \\left| x \\right| \\right)
Value: \\ln\\left( e \\right)

